{"ok": true, "summary": "The model represents a 320 × 180 × 12 mm aluminium cold plate with six longitudinal channel passes connected in series by five semicircular returns. The 10 × 6 mm passage is centered through the thickness, leaving 3 mm top and bottom skins. Pass spacing is 28 mm, giving 18 mm between straight passages and at least 10 mm lateral edge clearance. Both Ø12 mm fittings are on the same 180 mm short side. Calculations include two inlet/outlet transition passages and assume Ø8 mm fitting bores. Heat-transfer area is the internal wetted area, not the battery contact area. Fittings are idealized aluminium connectors without seals or locking details; their projections extend beyond the specified plate envelope.", "html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>EV battery cold plate</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#253344}\n#panel h3{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 8px}\n.row{margin:5px 0}\n.swatch{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;margin-right:5px}\nbutton{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:11px}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\n#buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:9px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:10%;width:80%;text-align:center;color:#b00020;background:white;padding:15px}\n#hint{position:absolute;bottom:12px;right:14px;font-size:12px;color:#526173}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>EV battery aluminium cold plate</h3>\n<div class=\"row\">Plate: 320 × 180 × 12 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\">6 series passes · channel 10 × 6 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\">Pitch 28 mm · skins 3 mm · ports Ø12 / Ø8</div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"mass\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"length\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"area\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><span class=\"swatch\" style=\"background:#d4d9e0\"></span>Aluminium plate and fittings</div>\n<div class=\"row\"><span class=\"swatch\" style=\"background:#3b82f6\"></span>Coolant passage; arrows indicate flow</div>\n<div id=\"buttons\"><button id=\"section\">Section view</button><button id=\"explode\">Exploded view</button><button id=\"rotate\">Auto-rotate: on</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<div id=\"hint\">Drag to orbit · scroll to zoom · section removes upper half</div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\nconst P = {\n  // All lengths are mm; density is g/cm³.\n  length:320, width:180, thickness:12,\n  passes:6, channelWidth:10, channelDepth:6, pitch:28,\n  straightStart:-130, straightEnd:130,\n  fittingOD:12, fittingID:8, fittingLength:22,\n  collarOD:16, collarLength:4, collarStart:5,\n  densityAl:2.70, minimumWall:1.5,\n  arcSegments:40, explosion:24\n};\nfunction showError(message){\n  const el=document.getElementById('error');\n  el.style.display='block';el.textContent='Model error: '+message;\n}\nwindow.addEventListener('error',e=>showError(e.message));\ntry{\n  const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));\n  renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  renderer.localClippingEnabled=true;\n  document.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene();\n  scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\n  const pmrem=new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer);\n  scene.environment=pmrem.fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(),0.04).texture;\n  scene.add(new THREE.HemisphereLight(0xffffff,0x8d8d8d,0.6));\n  const light=new THREE.DirectionalLight(0xffffff,1.2);\n  light.position.set(160,300,180);scene.add(light);\n  const camera=new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(40,innerWidth/innerHeight,1,20000);\n  const controls=new OrbitControls(camera,renderer.domElement);\n  controls.enableDamping=true;controls.autoRotate=true;controls.autoRotateSpeed=1.0;\n  const rotateButton=document.getElementById('rotate');\n  controls.addEventListener('start',()=>{controls.autoRotate=false;rotateButton.textContent='Auto-rotate: off';});\n  const modelGroup=new THREE.Group();scene.add(modelGroup);\n  const metal=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:'#d4d9e0',metalness:0.85,roughness:0.35,side:THREE.DoubleSide});\n  const water=new THREE.MeshStandardMaterial({color:'#3b82f6',metalness:0,roughness:0.3,transparent:true,opacity:0.55,depthWrite:false,side:THREE.DoubleSide});\n  const skin=(P.thickness-P.channelDepth)/2;\n  const radius=P.pitch/2;\n  const zFirst=-(P.passes-1)*P.pitch/2;\n  const straight=P.straightEnd-P.straightStart;\n  const lead=P.straightStart+P.length/2;\n  const channelLength=P.passes*straight+(P.passes-1)*Math.PI*radius+2*lead;\n  const voidVolume=P.channelWidth*P.channelDepth*channelLength;\n  const plateVolume=P.length*P.width*P.thickness-voidVolume;\n  const fittingVolume=2*Math.PI/4*((P.fittingOD**2-P.fittingID**2)*P.fittingLength+\n    (P.collarOD**2-P.fittingOD**2)*P.collarLength);\n  const plateMass=plateVolume*P.densityAl/1e6;\n  const mass=(plateVolume+fittingVolume)*P.densityAl/1e6;\n  // Includes two planar rectangular-to-round shoulders, excluding external fittings.\n  const shoulderArea=2*(P.channelWidth*P.channelDepth-Math.PI*P.fittingID**2/4);\n  const wettedArea=(2*(P.channelWidth+P.channelDepth)*channelLength+shoulderArea)/1e6;\n  window.__metrics=[\n    {label:\"Aluminium mass\",value:mass.toFixed(3),unit:\"kg\",note:\"Plate and two idealized fittings; 2700 kg/m³\"},\n    {label:\"Plate-only aluminium mass\",value:plateMass.toFixed(3),unit:\"kg\",note:\"Envelope less internal passage volume\"},\n    {label:\"Total channel length\",value:(channelLength/1000).toFixed(3),unit:\"m\",note:\"Centerline; includes leads, excludes fittings\"},\n    {label:\"Internal heat-transfer area\",value:wettedArea.toFixed(4),unit:\"m²\",note:\"Wetted passage and shoulders; no fittings\"},\n    {label:\"Channel fluid volume\",value:(voidVolume/1000).toFixed(2),unit:\"cm³\",note:\"Excludes fitting bores\"},\n    {label:\"Minimum plate wall\",value:skin.toFixed(1),unit:\"mm\",note:\"Top/bottom skins; required minimum 1.5 mm\"}\n  ];\n  document.getElementById('mass').textContent='Aluminium: '+mass.toFixed(3)+' kg (plate '+plateMass.toFixed(3)+')';\n  document.getElementById('length').textContent='Channel centerline: '+(channelLength/1000).toFixed(3)+' m';\n  document.getElementById('area').textContent='Internal wetted area: '+wettedArea.toFixed(4)+' m²';\n  function addBox(x,y,z,px,py,pz,material,parent=modelGroup){\n    const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.BoxGeometry(x,y,z),material);\n    mesh.position.set(px,py,pz);parent.add(mesh);return mesh;\n  }\n  const top=addBox(P.length,skin,P.width,0,(P.channelDepth+skin)/2,0,metal);\n  addBox(P.length,skin,P.width,0,-(P.channelDepth+skin)/2,0,metal);\n  // Continuous 2D channel centerline, including both open edge leads.\n  const points=[new THREE.Vector2(-P.length/2,zFirst),new THREE.Vector2(P.straightStart,zFirst)];\n  for(let i=0;i<P.passes;i++){\n    const z=zFirst+i*P.pitch;\n    const x=i%2===0?P.straightEnd:P.straightStart;\n    points.push(new THREE.Vector2(x,z));\n    if(i<P.passes-1){\n      for(let j=1;j<=P.arcSegments;j++){\n        const a=-Math.PI/2+j*Math.PI/P.arcSegments;\n        const side=i%2===0?1:-1;\n        points.push(new THREE.Vector2(x+side*radius*Math.cos(a),z+radius+radius*Math.sin(a)));\n      }\n    }\n  }\n  points.push(new THREE.Vector2(-P.length/2,zFirst+(P.passes-1)*P.pitch));\n  // Mitered offsets produce an open-ended ribbon and its complementary core.\n  const left=[],right=[],half=P.channelWidth/2;\n  for(let i=0;i<points.length;i++){\n    const before=points[i].clone().sub(points[Math.max(0,i-1)]);\n    const after=points[Math.min(points.length-1,i+1)].clone().sub(points[i]);\n    if(i===0)before.copy(after);\n    if(i===points.length-1)after.copy(before);\n    before.normalize();after.normalize();\n    const n1=new THREE.Vector2(-before.y,before.x),n2=new THREE.Vector2(-after.y,after.x);\n    const normal=n1.clone().add(n2).normalize();\n    const offset=normal.multiplyScalar(half/normal.dot(n1));\n    left.push(points[i].clone().add(offset));right.push(points[i].clone().sub(offset));\n  }\n  function prism(vertices,depth,material){\n    const shape=new THREE.Shape(vertices);\n    const geometry=new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(shape,{depth,bevelEnabled:false,steps:1});\n    geometry.rotateX(Math.PI/2);geometry.translate(0,depth/2,0);\n    const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(geometry,material);modelGroup.add(mesh);return mesh;\n  }\n  const coolant=prism([...left,...right.slice().reverse()],P.channelDepth,water);\n  // With both ports on the left edge, this simple boundary leaves a real channel void.\n  const coreBoundary=[\n    new THREE.Vector2(-P.length/2,-P.width/2),\n    new THREE.Vector2(P.length/2,-P.width/2),\n    new THREE.Vector2(P.length/2,P.width/2),\n    new THREE.Vector2(-P.length/2,P.width/2),\n    ...left.slice().reverse(),...right\n  ];\n  prism(coreBoundary,P.channelDepth,metal);\n  const fittingGroups=[];\n  function hollowCylinder(outer,inner,length,x,z,parent){\n    const shape=new THREE.Shape();\n    shape.absarc(0,0,outer/2,0,2*Math.PI,false);\n    const hole=new THREE.Path();hole.absarc(0,0,inner/2,0,2*Math.PI,true);shape.holes.push(hole);\n    const geometry=new THREE.ExtrudeGeometry(shape,{depth:length,bevelEnabled:false,curveSegments:40});\n    geometry.rotateY(-Math.PI/2);\n    const mesh=new THREE.Mesh(geometry,metal);mesh.position.set(x,0,z);parent.add(mesh);\n  }\n  for(const z of [zFirst,zFirst+(P.passes-1)*P.pitch]){\n    const group=new THREE.Group();modelGroup.add(group);fittingGroups.push(group);\n    hollowCylinder(P.fittingOD,P.fittingID,P.fittingLength,-P.length/2,z,group);\n    hollowCylinder(P.collarOD,P.fittingOD,P.collarLength,-P.length/2-P.collarStart,z,group);\n    const fluid=new THREE.Mesh(new THREE.CylinderGeometry(P.fittingID/2,P.fittingID/2,P.fittingLength,32),water);\n    fluid.rotation.z=Math.PI/2;fluid.position.set(-P.length/2-P.fittingLength/2,0,z);group.add(fluid);\n  }\n  const arrows=new THREE.Group();modelGroup.add(arrows);arrows.visible=false;\n  for(let i=0;i<P.passes;i++){\n    const dir=new THREE.Vector3(i%2===0?1:-1,0,0);\n    arrows.add(new THREE.ArrowHelper(dir,new THREE.Vector3(-dir.x*14,0.4,zFirst+i*P.pitch),28,0x124c96,6,4));\n  }\n  const grid=new THREE.GridHelper(500,25,0xdcd8d1,0xe9e5de);\n  grid.position.y=-P.thickness/2-0.4;scene.add(grid);\n  const box=new THREE.Box3().setFromObject(modelGroup,true);\n  const center=box.getCenter(new THREE.Vector3()),size=box.getSize(new THREE.Vector3());\n  function fit(){\n    const halfAngle=Math.min(camera.fov*Math.PI/360,Math.atan(Math.tan(camera.fov*Math.PI/360)*camera.aspect));\n    const distance=size.length()/2/Math.sin(halfAngle)/0.70;\n    camera.position.copy(center).add(new THREE.Vector3(1,0.7,1.2).normalize().multiplyScalar(distance));\n    controls.target.copy(center);controls.update();\n  }\n  fit();\n  let section=false,exploded=false;\n  const plane=new THREE.Plane(new THREE.Vector3(0,-1,0),0);\n  document.getElementById('section').onclick=()=>{\n    section=!section;metal.clippingPlanes=section?[plane]:[];metal.needsUpdate=true;\n    arrows.visible=section;document.getElementById('section').textContent=section?'Full view':'Section view';\n  };\n  document.getElementById('explode').onclick=()=>{\n    exploded=!exploded;top.position.y=(P.channelDepth+skin)/2+(exploded?P.explosion:0);\n    fittingGroups.forEach(group=>group.position.x=exploded?-P.explosion:0);\n    document.getElementById('explode').textContent=exploded?'Assembled view':'Exploded view';\n  };\n  rotateButton.onclick=()=>{controls.autoRotate=!controls.autoRotate;rotateButton.textContent='Auto-rotate: '+(controls.autoRotate?'on':'off');};\n  window.__scene=scene;window.__camera=camera;window.__renderer=renderer;\n  window.__controls=controls;window.__model=modelGroup;\n  window.addEventListener('resize',()=>{\n    camera.aspect=innerWidth/innerHeight;camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n    renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);fit();\n  });\n  renderer.setAnimationLoop(()=>{controls.update();renderer.render(scene,camera);});\n}catch(error){showError(error.message);}\n</script>\n</body>\n</html>", "metrics": [{"label": "Aluminium mass", "value": "1.575", "unit": "kg", "note": "Plate and two idealized fittings; 2700 kg/m³"}, {"label": "Plate-only aluminium mass", "value": "1.565", "unit": "kg", "note": "Envelope less internal passage volume"}, {"label": "Total channel length", "value": "1.840", "unit": "m", "note": "Centerline; includes leads, excludes fittings"}, {"label": "Internal heat-transfer area", "value": "0.0589", "unit": "m²", "note": "Wetted passage and shoulders; no fittings"}, {"label": "Channel fluid volume", "value": "110.39", "unit": "cm³", "note": "Excludes fitting bores"}, {"label": "Minimum plate wall", "value": "3.0", "unit": "mm", "note": "Top/bottom skins; required minimum 1.5 mm"}], "suggestions": ["Estimate pressure drop at 5 L/min using 50% water-glycol coolant.", "Compare this series serpentine layout with six parallel channels.", "Add a brazed cover, mounting holes, and detailed quick-connect interfaces."], "raw": "<<<SUMMARY>>>\nThe model represents a 320 × 180 × 12 mm aluminium cold plate with six longitudinal channel passes connected in series by five semicircular returns. The 10 × 6 mm passage is centered through the thickness, leaving 3 mm top and bottom skins. Pass spacing is 28 mm, giving 18 mm between straight passages and at least 10 mm lateral edge clearance. Both Ø12 mm fittings are on the same 180 mm short side. Calculations include two inlet/outlet transition passages and assume Ø8 mm fitting bores. Heat-transfer area is the internal wetted area, not the battery contact area. Fittings are idealized aluminium connectors without seals or locking details; their projections extend beyond the specified plate envelope.\n<<<HTML>>>\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width,initial-scale=1\">\n<title>EV battery cold plate</title>\n<style>\nhtml,body{margin:0;overflow:hidden;height:100%;font-family:\"Segoe UI\",sans-serif}\ncanvas{display:block}\n#panel{position:absolute;top:12px;left:12px;max-width:300px;padding:12px;background:rgba(255,255,255,.88);border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:8px;font-size:12px;color:#253344}\n#panel h3{font-size:15px;margin:0 0 8px}\n.row{margin:5px 0}\n.swatch{display:inline-block;width:10px;height:10px;border-radius:2px;margin-right:5px}\nbutton{background:white;border:1px solid #dedede;border-radius:6px;padding:4px 10px;cursor:pointer;font-size:11px}\nbutton:hover{border-color:#b11f4b}\n#buttons{display:flex;gap:4px;margin-top:9px;flex-wrap:wrap}\n#error{display:none;position:absolute;top:45%;left:10%;width:80%;text-align:center;color:#b00020;background:white;padding:15px}\n#hint{position:absolute;bottom:12px;right:14px;font-size:12px;color:#526173}\n</style>\n<script type=\"importmap\">{\"imports\":{\"three\":\"/static/vendor/three/three.module.js\",\"three/addons/\":\"/static/vendor/three/jsm/\"}}</script>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"panel\">\n<h3>EV battery aluminium cold plate</h3>\n<div class=\"row\">Plate: 320 × 180 × 12 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\">6 series passes · channel 10 × 6 mm</div>\n<div class=\"row\">Pitch 28 mm · skins 3 mm · ports Ø12 / Ø8</div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"mass\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"length\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\" id=\"area\"></div>\n<div class=\"row\"><span class=\"swatch\" style=\"background:#d4d9e0\"></span>Aluminium plate and fittings</div>\n<div class=\"row\"><span class=\"swatch\" style=\"background:#3b82f6\"></span>Coolant passage; arrows indicate flow</div>\n<div id=\"buttons\"><button id=\"section\">Section view</button><button id=\"explode\">Exploded view</button><button id=\"rotate\">Auto-rotate: on</button></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"error\"></div>\n<div id=\"hint\">Drag to orbit · scroll to zoom · section removes upper half</div>\n<script type=\"module\">\nimport * as THREE from 'three';\nimport { OrbitControls } from 'three/addons/controls/OrbitControls.js';\nimport { RoomEnvironment } from 'three/addons/environments/RoomEnvironment.js';\nconst P = {\n  // All lengths are mm; density is g/cm³.\n  length:320, width:180, thickness:12,\n  passes:6, channelWidth:10, channelDepth:6, pitch:28,\n  straightStart:-130, straightEnd:130,\n  fittingOD:12, fittingID:8, fittingLength:22,\n  collarOD:16, collarLength:4, collarStart:5,\n  densityAl:2.70, minimumWall:1.5,\n  arcSegments:40, explosion:24\n};\nfunction showError(message){\n  const el=document.getElementById('error');\n  el.style.display='block';el.textContent='Model error: '+message;\n}\nwindow.addEventListener('error',e=>showError(e.message));\ntry{\n  const renderer=new THREE.WebGLRenderer({antialias:true,preserveDrawingBuffer:true});\n  renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(devicePixelRatio,2));\n  renderer.setSize(innerWidth,innerHeight);\n  renderer.localClippingEnabled=true;\n  document.body.appendChild(renderer.domElement);\n  const scene=new THREE.Scene();\n  scene.background=new THREE.Color('#f7f4ef');\n  const pmrem=new THREE.PMREMGenerator(renderer);\n  scene.environment=pmrem.fromScene(new RoomEnvironment(),0.04).texture;\n  scene.add(new THREE.H